{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_099_1000_033sih", "source_sha256": "67f60289ce478c7128ce3bcf9373fd3a34d34833568e99e6d14d174ef6f82f99", "ja": "そろそろ、ですね……。\n節目になるものだから、\nちゃんとやらないと。", "zh": "差不多该开始了吧……\n毕竟是个重要的节点，\n可得好好完成才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_099_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "7d25a546deb4d63f32f6a50dff089cf7a51a0f124e58f27d8dc9d7da20ef41ad", "ja": "うん、頑張ろう！\nでも、それだけじゃなくて、\nボクたちも楽しまなきゃだよね！", "zh": "嗯，加油吧！\n不过，不仅如此，\n我们自己也得乐在其中才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_099_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "6d9409142b1eac90b8b0d518d14dd9968e0ed953d8b7b8995ffda79e18a00ea7", "ja": "楽しく、頑張る！　まさに\n私たちの劇場のテーマって\n感じですよね。よーし！", "zh": "开心地努力！这正是我们剧场的主题呢。好——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_099_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "abd2c608be0d0fa25bb47bb36bd7ca7cfc8be5a1ff1ec624ec7a8dcfacafe8eb", "ja": "ふふ。……紗代子さんも\n真さんも、いつも前向きで、\n頼りになります。", "zh": "呵呵……纱代子和真总是积极向上，真是值得依靠。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_099_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "06908558b5202367ec11fd6d4433198aede2ce7f9605b3e1d698362970d8678c", "ja": "ホント！？　なら、もっともっと\n頼ってくれていいんだよ、志保！\nボクたち、お姉さんだからね！", "zh": "真的吗！？那你可以更加、更加依赖我们哦，志保！\n毕竟，我们可是姐姐嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_099_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "d504211e38294cc8d9ef87ae57bc69486037a98f4a2745c531ce4f7eb2af9275", "ja": "もちろん私もだよ、志保ちゃん！\n志保ちゃんに頼られるなんて、\nなんだか感慨深いなぁ……。", "zh": "我也是哦，志保！\n能被志保依赖，\n总觉得好感慨呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
